OL,3,AAlaska governor orders probe into
OL,4,ADemocratic campaign's alleged links to
OL,5,Asame-name candidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Republican governor of Alaska has
OL,8,Fordered an investigation into an
OL,9,Falleged "scheme" designed "to
OL,10,Fmanipulate Alaska's elections".
OL,12,FGovernor Mike Dunleavy said he was
OL,13,Fresponding to a New York Times (NYT)
OL,14,Freport. The story said the team of
OL,15,FDemocratic candidate Mary Peltola
OL,16,Fworked with people who tried to recruit
OL,17,Fa man to contest the Senate race who
OL,18,Fshares their name with Peltola's
OL,19,Fopponent, Dan Sullivan.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
