OL,3,AAlaska governor orders probe into
OL,4,ADemocratic campaign's alleged links to
OL,5,Asame-name candidate
OL,6,
OL,7,FSullivan, the incumbent senator, and
OL,8,Ffellow Republicans have accused the
OL,9,FDemocrats of trying to confuse voters.
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump has called for
OL,11,FPeltola to be barred.
OL,13,FPeltola's team deny any wrongdoing, or
OL,14,Fencouraging the second Dan Sullivan to
OL,15,Fstand in the tight contest.
